Closing Statement:  Mrs. Hooker was remanded in Foundation custody for further questioning but upon rousing became withdrawn and uncooperative. She was placed into a standard humanoid containment cell overnight while SCP-5295's removal was carried out. The next morning, Mrs. Hooker was discovered to have drowned herself in the bowl of the toilet in her cell. Agent Cooke's remains were quietly retrieved from ███████ sewage treatment works two days later.
